<title>POLAND: BPH MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 29.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 29.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 29.75 vs   26.68</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   29.21 vs   32.83</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 62.82 vs   55.84</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	99.41 vs  117.70</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 74.51 vs   82.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  105.37 vs  124.23</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		180.10 vs  167.95</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     289.49 vs  256.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Przemyslowo -</p>
<p>Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
